{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hequan-e-o165","title":"鲂笺五陈鄱阳民乱心江边空虚","accounts":[{"id":"hequan-a-c2747f8195b3c5dfa26d","label":"正文","text":"鲂笺五陈鄱阳民乱心江边空虚","evidence":["hequan-q-ba8ad1db3a8035eac57a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0058","role":"笺称鄱阳之民实多愚劲倡之为变闻声响抃、今虽降首盘节未解乱心犹存、东主图兴大众举国悉出江边空旷屯坞虚损、若因是际骚动此民一旦可得便会然要恃外援表里机互","evidence":["hequan-q-ba8ad1db3a8035eac57a"]},{"person":"wendi-p0039","role":"受笺者","evidence":["hequan-q-ba8ad1db3a8035eac57a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["hequan-q-ba8ad1db3a8035eac57a"]},"ordering_evidence":"hequan-q-ba8ad1db3a8035eac57a","source_order":[60,306,0],"order":10650}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0039","name":"曹休","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0058","name":"周鲂","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hequan-q-ba8ad1db3a8035eac57a","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-28f2eb1aaa36de8800e8","layer":"original","quote":"其五曰：“鄱阳之民，实多愚劲。帅之赴役，未即应人；倡之为变〖10〗，闻声响抃〖11〗。今虽降首，盘节未解；山栖草藏，乱心犹存。而今东主图兴大众，举国悉出；江边空旷，屯坞虚损，惟有诸刺奸耳〖12〗。若因是际而骚动此民〖13〗，一旦可得便会〖14〗；然要恃外援，表里机互〖15〗；不尔以往〖16〗，无所成也","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":305,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
